# Sentence case for UI copy

ParkourSpot UI strings use **sentence case**, not Title Case.

- Capitalize the first word only.
- Also capitalize proper nouns and acronyms (API, URLs, Jumpflix, ParkourSpot).
- Apply to buttons, field labels, screen titles, section headings, and menu items.

Examples:

- Add new spot (not Add New Spot)
- Spot management (not Spot Management)
- Training activity (not My Training Activity)
- Generate sitemaps (not Generate Sitemaps)

When adding or changing user-facing English copy in `l10n/app_en.arb`, follow this convention. Other locales should follow their own language norms (e.g. German noun capitalization).
